The prompt gamma-ray spectrum for thermal radiative capture       1425 1451
(MF12 MT 102) has been updated with new experimental data [Fi07], 1425 1451
[IAEA07]. This entailed installing new capture lines and scaling  1425 1451
the yields using the total thermal cross section in (MF 3  MT 102)1425 1451
to conserve total decay energy compared to the thermal Q value.   1425 1451
