       interaction cross sections from DWUCK [Ku72] calculations  1425 1451
       (when data available).                                     1425 1451
    MT=91  Inelastic scattering exciting the continuum calculated 1425 1451
       by code TNG with guidance from (n,xn) emission data.       1425 1451
