       taken from resonance parameters.  From 1.75 to 20 MeV,     1425 1451
       evaluation based on TNG calculation, normalized to         1425 1451
       available data at 14.7 MeV.  Thermal value = 0.169 barns   1425 1451
       [Ra92].                                                    1425 1451
    MT=103 (n,p) cross sections were calculated by the code TNG   1425 1451
       [Fu88],[Fu80],[Sh86] from 9.0 to 20.0 MeV.  From threshold 1425 1451
        to 9.0 MeV, taken from ENDF/B-V evaluation.               1425 1451
    MT=107 (n,a) cross sections were calculated by the code TNG   1425 1451
